{"schema":2,"shard":5,"views":{"tenderhub":"\n    <div class=\"hub-hero\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Tenders</div><h2>Track the bid, then close the proof gaps.</h2><p class=\"muted\">The tender area starts with opportunities you already know about and the evidence needed to prepare. It remains a readiness workspace, not a tender-feed or award guarantee.</p></div><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"tenderready\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('tenderready')\">Check readiness</button></div>\n    <div class=\"outcome-status-strip\" aria-label=\"Tender status summary\">\n      <span class=\"outcome-status-chip\"><b id=\"tenderHubTracked\">—</b> tracked tenders</span>\n      <span class=\"outcome-status-chip\"><b id=\"tenderHubClosingSoon\">—</b> closing within 14 days</span>\n      <span class=\"outcome-status-chip\"><b id=\"tenderHubApplicability\">—</b> tender workflow</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"outcome-grid outcome-grid-2\">\n      <button class=\"outcome-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"tenderready\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('tenderready')\"><span class=\"section-eyebrow\">Tracked opportunities</span><b>Tender workspace</b><span id=\"tenderHubTrackingDetail\" class=\"outcome-card-status\">Record a known tender, issuer and closing date, then keep the workspace current.</span><span class=\"outcome-card-action\">Open tender workspaces →</span></button>\n      <button class=\"outcome-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"tender\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('tender')\"><span class=\"section-eyebrow\">Submission preparation</span><b>Evidence readiness</b><span id=\"tenderHubReadinessDetail\" class=\"outcome-card-status\">Check the reusable evidence baseline, then verify every tender-specific requirement before submission.</span><span class=\"outcome-card-action\">Check evidence gaps →</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <details class=\"hub-specialist-details tender-specialist-details\">\n      <summary>Reusable tender support <span class=\"muted small\">Verified proof and external sharing</span></summary>\n      <div class=\"hub-specialist-inner hub-grid\">\n        <button class=\"hub-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"compliancepassport\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('compliancepassport')\"><span class=\"hub-icon\">◇</span><span><b>Share verified proof</b><small>Package current verified controls for consented external sharing where appropriate.</small></span><span class=\"hub-arrow\">→</span></button>\n        <button class=\"hub-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"evidencehub\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('evidencehub')\"><span class=\"hub-icon\">▣</span><span><b>Documents & proof</b><small>Review evidence status before relying on it for a tender requirement.</small></span><span class=\"hub-arrow\">→</span></button>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  ","accountsecurity":"\n    <div class=\"grid g3\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Sign-in methods</div><div id=\"securityMethods\" class=\"score\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Active sessions</div><div id=\"activeSessionCount\" class=\"score\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Recovery</div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">Email reset</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Session security</h2>\n        <div class=\"muted small\">Review currently active sign-in sessions. Use “Sign out everywhere” if you lose a device or suspect unauthorized access.</div>\n        <div id=\"sessionList\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn danger\" style=\"margin-top:12px\" data-bw-onclick=\"signOutEverywhere()\">Sign out everywhere</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Account recovery</h2>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <div><label for=\"recoveryEmail\">Account email</label><input id=\"recoveryEmail\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\"></div>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"requestPasswordReset()\">Send password reset</button>\n          <div class=\"muted small\">For privacy, the response is the same whether or not the email exists.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  ","payments":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Pending</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"paymentPending\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Paid</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"paymentPaid\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Failed</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"paymentFailed\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Refunded</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"paymentRefunded\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><h2>Payment providers</h2><div id=\"paymentProviderList\" class=\"muted small\">Loading provider readiness…</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h2>Payment orders</h2><div id=\"paymentOrderList\" class=\"muted small\">No payment orders yet.</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><h2>Reconciliation</h2>\n    <div class=\"notice\"><b>Browser return is not proof of payment</b><div class=\"small\">Subscription activation, AI credits and paid services still require provider-side verification.</div></div>\n    <div id=\"paymentReconciliationList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No reconciliation events yet.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><h2>Provider verification</h2>\n      <div class=\"notice\"><b>Only verified-paid can fulfill an order.</b><div class=\"small\">Pending, mismatched, fraud-review and provider-error checks remain non-settled.</div></div>\n      <div id=\"paymentVerificationList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No provider verification checks yet.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h2>Refund control</h2>\n      <div class=\"muted small\">Refunds are operations-controlled. AI-credit and professional-service reversals are blocked when automatic reversal would create inconsistent state.</div>\n      <div id=\"paymentRefundList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No refunds yet.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n","businessevents":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Recent events</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"businessEventCount\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Processing</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"businessEventProcessing\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Partial</div><div class=\"score warn\" id=\"businessEventPartial\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Failed</div><div class=\"score bad\" id=\"businessEventFailed\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Event-driven protection</div><h2>Business Event Engine</h2>\n      <div class=\"notice\"><b>A business change should trigger a compliance recheck.</b><div class=\"small\">Profile, workforce, licence, tender and corporate events automatically re-run relevant regulatory, statutory, control, risk and evidence-readiness logic. Financial threshold changes are recorded only as “changed” events; the event ledger does not copy the amounts.</div></div>\n      <div id=\"businessEventList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No events yet.</div><div id=\"businessEventImpactDetail\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Report a major change</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid g2\">\n        <div><label for=\"manualBusinessEventType\">Event</label><select id=\"manualBusinessEventType\">\n          <option value=\"ownership_changed\">Ownership changed</option>\n          <option value=\"premises_changed\">Premises changed</option>\n          <option value=\"new_branch_opened\">New branch opened</option>\n          <option value=\"business_activity_changed\">Business activity changed</option>\n          <option value=\"manufacturing_started\">Manufacturing started</option>\n          <option value=\"manufacturing_stopped\">Manufacturing stopped</option>\n          <option value=\"vat_registration_changed\">VAT registration changed</option>\n          <option value=\"paye_registration_changed\">PAYE registration changed</option>\n        </select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"manualBusinessEventReason\">Reason / note</label><input id=\"manualBusinessEventReason\" placeholder=\"Short factual note\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" style=\"margin-top:10px\" data-bw-onclick=\"reportBusinessEvent()\">Report & recheck</button>\n      <div class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Reporting an event does not itself change legal status, ownership, tax registration or licence status. Update the relevant authoritative business record as well.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n"}}